# Squeak By: "Target creature you control gets +1/+1 until end of turn. It can't be blocked by creatures with power 3 or
# greater this turn." (CR 509.1b, 611.2a). Turn 3 Bot1 casts it as an Adventure on Mouse #1 (3/2): Bot2's Cliffhaven
# Sell-Sword (power exactly 3) may not block it, Elite Vanguard (power 2) may, and they trade. The Adventure card is exiled and
# cast as the second Mouse (CR 715.3d), which on turn 5 is a plain 2/1 that Sell-Sword may block. Squeak By can not target the
# opponent's creature. That the effect ends with the turn is cheeky-house-mouse-squeak-by-ends-with-the-turn.

